  "teacherNotes": "Production B, normal single-character L385 字 ㄗˋ. Base 250ca4a3361a15104ba19158bb1b0710dac43ecc, formal L001-L375, 379 learned Han. Actual learner dependencies L380-L384: 連/傳/相/信/寫. Allowed 385. Release playable blockers: R045/R046 after L375 and preceding L376-L384, not Production blockers. No additional provisional vocabulary outside coverage. 相 in 相信/相同 reads ㄒㄧㄤ; 傳 reads ㄔㄨㄢˊ. No readable writing exception: all illustration marks must be unrecognizable, matching pairs on S05 still visibly identical. S03 before digital transmission to absent mother; S04 physical card to rear classmate, not whisper game. isCorrect from handoff normalized to supported correct field without changing meaning.",
